OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain at
OL,6,Ftimes this evening. Then the rest of
OL,7,Fthe night will remain cloudy with
OL,8,Ffurther spells of rain. A windy night
OL,9,Fwith strong southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FOvernight rain soon clearing
OL,12,Fto leave a bright day with few light
OL,13,Fpassing showers. Fresh west or
OL,14,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,17,Fspells and occasional showers on
OL,18,FTuesday and Wednesday. Drier and
OL,19,Fcolder on Thursday with fewer showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
